{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_01",
      "hash": "28fceded578acd02",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\c\\nThis Gym is—"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_01",
      "hash": "5d983f69274032b5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: Here we go!\\nFirst question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_02",
      "hash": "28fceced578acb4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "W-wait, Mr. Blaine!\\nIt’s not your turn yet!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_02",
      "hash": "5d983c6927402d9c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Oh, that’s right!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_03",
      "hash": "28fcebed578ac99c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Er, the old man you just saw there was\\nthe Gym Leader, Blaine.\\r\\nHe is a Fire-type Pokémon pro!\\c\\nYou did well finding the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Key[VAR COLOR(0000)] to get in\\nhere, so I think you’re ready to take on this Gym!\\c\\nAs you might have guessed, you’ll have to take\\non a quiz at this Gym, as well as battles.\\r\\nTry to have a good time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_04",
      "hash": "28fceaed578ac7e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Go on! Get in there and enjoy some\\nsizzling battles and heated quizzes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_05",
      "hash": "28fce9ed578ac636",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]! You did it!\\nYou beat that firebrand!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_03",
      "hash": "5d983d6927402f4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: What d’you say?\\nReady to start?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_04",
      "hash": "5d983a6927402a36",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "All righty, then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_05",
      "hash": "5d983b6927402be9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "No need to be shy, then. Step right up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_06",
      "hash": "5d983869274026d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Here we go!\\nThis is the Cinnabar Island Gym Pokémon Quiz!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_07",
      "hash": "5d98396927402883",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Challengers get asked five questions that they\\nhave to answer.\\c\\nGet one right, and you get a Blaine doll!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_08",
      "hash": "5d98466927403e9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Get a question wrong, and you’ll have to battle\\none of my students here.\\c\\nBut if you manage to beat them...then don’t\\nworry—you still get a Blaine doll!\\c\\nThink you can collect five Blaine dolls?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_09",
      "hash": "5d9847692740404d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Here we go!\\nThe first question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_01",
      "hash": "ff3cc2b88ab47450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Quiz time!\\c\\nWhich of these is the Spitfire Pokémon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_01",
      "hash": "427ed350510c0079",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Magmar"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_02",
      "hash": "427ed050510bfb60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Growlithe"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_10",
      "hash": "5d9b44692742710b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: All right!\\nLet’s move on to the second question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_02",
      "hash": "ff3cc5b88ab47969",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Quiz time!\\c\\nHow many Gym Badges certified by\\nthe Pokémon League are there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_03",
      "hash": "427ed150510bfd13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Seven"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_04",
      "hash": "427ed650510c0592",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Eight"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_11",
      "hash": "5d9b436927426f58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: We’re not done yet!\\nThe second question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_06",
      "hash": "28fce8ed578ac483",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MAN: Hold on! Mr. Blaine!\\nThis is the third question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_12",
      "hash": "5d9b466927427471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: The third question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_03",
      "hash": "ff3cc4b88ab477b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Quiz time!\\c\\nA Steel-type move used on a Fire-type Pokémon\\nwill be...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_05",
      "hash": "427ed750510c0745",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Super effective!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_06",
      "hash": "427ed450510c022c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Not very effective"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_quiz_01_p04_t009_r0101",
      "hash": "03ef5b9403184a86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 27]"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_quiz_01_p06_t009_r0101",
      "hash": "a2bea715e3569344",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 28]"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_13",
      "hash": "5d9b4569274272be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: The challenger has assembled three\\nBlaine dolls!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_29",
      "hash": "5d913b69273a0d3b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "On to the fourth question!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_04",
      "hash": "ff3cc7b88ab47ccf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Quiz time!\\c\\nTrue or false!\\nTM28 contains the move Tombstony."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_07",
      "hash": "427ed550510c03df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "True"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_08",
      "hash": "427eda50510c0c5e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "False"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_09",
      "hash": "427edb50510c0e11",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What’s that?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_14",
      "hash": "5d9b4869274277d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: It seems our challenger has collected\\nfour Blaine dolls!\\c\\nIt’s time for the last question.\\nGive it your all!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_05",
      "hash": "ff3cc6b88ab47b1c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Final question!\\c\\nChallenger [VAR TRNAME(0000)], tell me...\\nwho are you about to battle?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_10",
      "hash": "42825850510f184f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Blaine"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_11",
      "hash": "42825750510f169c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The Cinnabar Island Gym Leader"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_12",
      "hash": "42825a50510f1bb5",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A Fire-type Pokémon pro"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_13",
      "hash": "42825950510f1a02",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A hotheaded quiz master"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_14",
      "hash": "42825450510f1183",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A moustached old man"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_15",
      "hash": "42825350510f0fd0",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "An old guy in sunglasses"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_16",
      "hash": "42825650510f14e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 43]"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_17",
      "hash": "42825550510f1336",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 44]"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_15",
      "hash": "5d9b476927427624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: The challenger has given h[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0202)]iser response!\\nAnd the final judgment is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_06",
      "hash": "ff3cc9b88ab48035",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’re absolutely correct!\\nCongrats!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_07",
      "hash": "ff3cc8b88ab47e82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Sorry!\\nBad call!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_16",
      "hash": "5d9b4a6927427b3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Congratulations!\\nYou’ve won a Blaine doll!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_17",
      "hash": "5d9b49692742798a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Too bad!\\nYou were close...but ultimately wrong!\\c\\nThe challenger must now face a penalty match\\nagainst one of the Trainers I instruct!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_18",
      "hash": "5d9b3c6927426373",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: A hard-won victory!\\nYou’ve won a Blaine doll!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_19",
      "hash": "5d9b3b69274261c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLAINE: Hah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_24",
      "hash": "5d913669273a04bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Challenger! You have obtained five Blaine dolls!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_25",
      "hash": "5d913769273a066f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Which means...\\nit’s time for our battle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_26",
      "hash": "5d913869273a0822",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m Blaine, the red-hot Gym Leader here!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_27",
      "hash": "5d913969273a09d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "My fiery Pokémon are all rough and ready with\\nintense heat! They incinerate all challengers!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_28",
      "hash": "5d913a69273a0b88",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hah!\\nHope you brought some Burn Heals!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_07_02",
      "hash": "a4212e53d369a560",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 57]"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_23",
      "hash": "5d913569273a0309",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You have earned a Volcano Badge!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_08",
      "hash": "ff3ccbb88ab4839b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got a [VAR COLOR(0006)]Volcano Badge[VAR COLOR(0000)] from Blaine!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_20",
      "hash": "5d9132692739fdf0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Here, you can have this TM, too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_09",
      "hash": "ff3ccab88ab481e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got [VAR ITEM2(0001)] [VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)] from Blaine."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_21",
      "hash": "5d9133692739ffa3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM46 contains Fire Blast, a red-hot\\nFire-type move!\\c\\nTeach it to Fire-type Pokémon.\\c\\nVulpix or Charmeleon would be ideal."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_22",
      "hash": "5d913469273a0156",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Fire Blast is an attack to be shown the\\nutmost respect.\\c\\nDon’t waste it on Water-type Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_07_13",
      "hash": "a424b753d36cc402",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 64]"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "e734b77852176f89",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I look forward to more heated battles and\\nsizzling quizzes today!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_01_02",
      "hash": "e734b47852176a70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What a fantastic battle! Even I was heating up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_02_01",
      "hash": "b85eb76044c5f3d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You think there are any other Fire-type\\nGym Leaders out there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_02_02",
      "hash": "b85eb66044c5f223",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’re pretty tough. Ever thought about\\nbecoming a Gym Leader?"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldw_01",
      "hash": "b9fb0fcd6a945377",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Blaine’s not very good as an emcee, but he’s\\nred hot when it comes to battles!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldw_02",
      "hash": "b9fb10cd6a94552a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You and Blaine did great!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "id": "msg_main8060_nresearcher_01",
      "hash": "c8aa82fb5a887513",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Blaine’s always thinking up ways to keep\\nthe families of the scientists who live here from\\r\\ngetting bored."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childm_01",
      "hash": "b995ef96c9f32a92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hahaha! Blaine’s so funny!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childm_02",
      "hash": "b995ee96c9f328df",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I sure would like a Blaine doll..."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "id": "msg_main8060_middlew_01",
      "hash": "9ce1049e473a73e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s not too much to get excited about\\nhere on Cinnabar Island."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "id": "msg_main8060_middlew_02",
      "hash": "9ce1019e473a6ed0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Recently there’s been a lot of strong challengers,\\nso things have been pretty lively."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childf_01",
      "hash": "4879fff09d725dfd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Good luck out there, Trainer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childf_02",
      "hash": "4879fcf09d7258e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Your [VAR POKNAME(0002)] looked so cute while\\nyou were taking the quiz!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "id": "msg_main8060_boy_01",
      "hash": "e75cfb1b89c05ad1",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m not a Trainer, but I still enjoy watching Blaine!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "id": "msg_main8060_boy_02",
      "hash": "e75cf81b89c055b8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I finally got one of Blaine’s questions right!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "8abc15877b5e3e17",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you know how hot Pokémon\\nfire breath can get?"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "f3e884c4b24e3400",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 81]"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "98b31de0b287c8e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You see, fire starts when... ... ...but to be more\\nprecise, it’s really combustion... ... ...and then\\r\\nthe oxygen in the air... ... ...and after that it...\\c\\nHey! Hey! Are you listening to me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "51c090c3a274e934",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I used to be a thief, but I went straight."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "68bceb3de49b2b21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 84]"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "8823de5b821025d2",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I get this uncontrollable urge to steal other\\npeople’s Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "a04f035ee09f091e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you know why Blaine became a Trainer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "749b8fb17f524777",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 87]"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "e50edd97b678cba4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Blaine got lost in the mountains while hiking.\\nWhen night fell, a fiery bird Pokémon appeared.\\c\\nIts light allowed Blaine to find his way down\\nto safety."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "6128544511eb2a5b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’ve been to many Gyms, but this one best suits\\nmy style."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "589467d7a51fbfe4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 90]"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "f239b69c243817cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Rapidash, Ninetales—those are popular\\nFire-type Pokémon."
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8060_max",
      "hash": "f135a315927e392d"
    }
  ]
}
